<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador launches sale of Banco Continental.</title>
<headline>Ecuador launches sale of Banco Continental.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ecuadorean government on Monday launched the sale of rescued Banco Continental with a call for bids by May 2.</p>
<p>A central bank official said recently that five domestic banks and two foreign banks had expressed interest in the institution that officials saved from collapse in March 1996 with a $160 million loan.</p>
<p>Banco Continental is ranked among Ecuador's top five banks in terms of assets. Swiss Bank Corp has been advising authorities on Continental's restructuring.</p>
<p>((-Gustavo Oviedo, Quito Newsroom, +5932 258 433))</p>
